# Numeric-only native Item physics: run ITEM_HULLS=1 and ITEM_HULLS=0 on a fresh NEWWORLD.
# Each support is real collision geometry, checked with native landRay before insertion.
# events.jsonl records census, each drop, all results and 50-item native physics p95.
# Compare sleep_ms ON <= OFF on flat/table; slope/stairs allow sleep or escaped_edge.
# Final pivots outside the support footprint count as escaped_edge, not passed_through.
# Flat/slope/table/load use 1 m cells; giant_quad retains the original report-only support.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
item-hulls census
item-hulls setup flat
wait 7000
item-hulls report
# Let rounded items finish rolling off the 24 m sloped support.
item-hulls setup slope
wait 20000
item-hulls report
item-hulls setup stairs
wait 7000
item-hulls report
item-hulls setup table
wait 7000
item-hulls report
item-hulls setup load
wait 8000
item-hulls report
item-hulls setup giant_quad
wait 8000
item-hulls report
item-hulls clear
